[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8857\u306E\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3001\u76F8\u5909\u308F\u3089\u305A\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u304C\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306A\u3041",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone in town is as lively as ever!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u56DE\u3063\u305F\u6642\u3088\u308A\u3001\n\u3082\u3063\u3068\u4EBA\u304C\u5897\u3048\u3066\u308B\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think there are even more people here than when Plachta and I went around together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u3092\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u306A\u3041\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone must be looking forward to the Linde Festival..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u8857\u306E\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306F\u3069\u3093\u306A\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3067\u3001\n\u3000\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u8D08\u308A\u5408\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder what feelings people have when they exchange chocolates during the Linde Festival?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30AB\u30D5\u30A7\u3067\u3001\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3\u3055\u3093\u3068\u3082\u8A71\u3057\u305F\u901A\u308A\u2015\u2015\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Like I discussed with Roman at the cafe\u2014)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3082\u305D\u3082\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306F\u3001\u5927\u5207\u306A\u4EBA\u306E\u7121\u4E8B\u3092\n\u3000\u7948\u308B\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The Linde Festival originally started as a way to pray for the safety of loved ones...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3063\u3066\u3002\n\u3000\u30E9\u30F3\u30C4\u30A7\u3055\u3093\u3084\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3\u3055\u3093\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306B\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But that\u0027s not all. Like Lanze and Heidi...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u81EA\u5206\u306A\u308A\u306E\u60F3\u3044\u3092\u62B1\u3048\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u3092\u697D\u3057\u3093\u3067\u308B\u4EBA\u305F\u3061\u3082\u3044\u3066\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(There are people enjoying the festival with their own personal feelings)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3064\u307E\u308A\u2026\u2026\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\u3001\n\u3000\u305F\u3060\u5927\u5207\u306A\u4EBA\u306B\u6E21\u3059\u8D08\u308A\u3082\u306E\u3001\u3063\u3066\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(In other words... chocolate isn\u0027t just a simple gift for someone special)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5927\u5207\u306A\u4EBA\u3078\u306E\u7948\u308A\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3001\n\u3000\u81EA\u5206\u81EA\u8EAB\u306E\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3082\u4E57\u305B\u3066\u8D08\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3001\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306A\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It\u0027s something you give along with your prayers and feelings for the person you care about)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u8003\u3048\u304C\u307E\u3068\u307E\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I think I\u0027ve got it figured out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3064\u307E\u308A\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u304C\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\n\u4F5C\u3089\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\u306E\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what I need to make now is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3001\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u304C\u3084\u308B\u3079\u304D\u3053\u3068\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And to make that chocolate, what I need to do is...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u30FC\u3057\u3001\u6C7A\u3081\u305F\uFF01\n\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u306B\u623B\u308D\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, it\u0027s decided!\nBack to the atelier!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]